flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Patient Selects Doctor]
    B --> C[Patient Selects Date]
    C --> D[Fetch Available Slots]
    D --> E{Slot Available?}

    E -- Yes --> F[Book Appointment]
    F --> G[Appointment Created]
    G --> H[Mark Slot as Unavailable]
    H --> I([End])

    E -- No --> J[Show Slot Unavailable Message]
    J --> I